[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0000","text":"采访者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0010","text":"今天请到了备受瞩目的新人偶像，\n铃木羽那小姐和郁田阳希小姐～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0020","text":"请多关照～／请多关照……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0001","text":"采访者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0030","text":"两位目前以个人身份活动，\n但前几天，是以组合的形式出演了演唱会对吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0040","text":"是的\n和阳希酱，还有今天没到场的──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0050","text":"『斑鸠路加酱一起』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0002","text":"采访者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0060","text":"作为偶像前辈的\n斑鸠路加小姐同台演出，感觉如何？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0070","text":"──是啊，\n路加酱……超级可靠的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0003","text":"采访者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0080","text":"是这样啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0004","text":"采访者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0090","text":"那么，请问郁田小姐\n作为组合站上舞台开心吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0100","text":"是的……！　非常……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0110","text":"真的是一转眼就……结束了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0111","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0120","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0005","text":"采访者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0130","text":"『据说CoMETIK今后的活动\n　目前还未定……』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0006","text":"采访者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0140","text":"『如果还有下一次机会的话\n　你们想做什么呢？』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0150","text":"『我想跟路加酱\n　多学一些舞蹈吧』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0007","text":"采访者"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0160","text":"『不错呢～\n　阳希小姐呢？』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0170","text":"『嗯……』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0180","text":"『希望能做出\n　只有我们才能完成的舞台……！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0190","text":"──的舞步，是参考了那个的哦\n我要跳了，看着──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0191","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0192","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0200","text":"那种东西，根本不存在──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_02_0201","text":"Motion"}]
